Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.56,0:00:05.71,Note,,0,0,0,,(走过的路)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.71,0:00:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你就要死了 Sam - 别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're dying,Sam - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.92,0:00:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ezekiel 他是个很好的战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ezekiel,he's a good soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.61,0:00:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我也许可以治好你弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a chance that I can fix your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.23,0:00:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,从他身体里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.23,0:00:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信你 Zeke\N{\fnArial\fs30}I’m trusting you,Zeke.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.13,0:00:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Metatron骗了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron tricked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.47,0:00:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他夺走了我的荣光\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took my grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.44,0:00:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在是人类了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That’s why I’m human.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.42,0:00:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能再把天使们送回天堂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no putting the angels back in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.20,0:00:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,天堂被锁上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven is locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.28,0:00:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋 Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it,Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.16,0:00:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,外面正在打仗 是你挑起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a war on and it's on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.92,0:00:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.04,0:00:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是Ezekiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it isn't Ezekiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.28,0:00:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Gadreel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gadreel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.06,0:00:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你想做新天堂的主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You intended to be the ruler of this new heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.38,0:00:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我会作为副手加入你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will join you as second in command.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.58,0:00:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你要除掉的第一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the first name on your to-do list.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.35,0:00:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫Abaddon\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.21,0:00:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我的一贯处理方式就是以暴制暴\N{\fnArial\fs30}War is what I do with my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.83,0:00:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我能给你们找到新的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can get you new bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.75,0:00:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我将进军地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will march into hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.06,0:00:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,所有人类 天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all the humans and all the angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.81,0:00:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,都将臣服于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will bow to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.05,0:00:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,天使在互相残杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angels are slaughtering one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.93,0:00:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,战争已经打响了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an open warfare.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.00,0:00:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,没人能逃过一劫\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one will survive this war.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.41,0:00:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我不得不这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did what I had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.69,0:00:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,取回我的荣光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got my grace back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.45,0:00:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.14,0:00:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.91,0:00:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Kevin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.18,0:01:02.54,Note,,0,0,0,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.72,0:01:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,想象大桥坍塌之时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think in terms of bridges burned.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.67,0:01:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,想象四季更迭之际\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think of seasons that must end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.71,0:01:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,看潮起又潮落\N{\fnArial\fs30}See the rivers rise and fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.10,0:01:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,生生世世永不停歇\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will rise and fall again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.17,0:01:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,万物皆有终\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything must have an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.80,0:02:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,就像大海终将投向岸边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like an ocean to a shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.29,0:02:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,就像河流必汇聚成川\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a river to a stream.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.79,0:02:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,当屏幕灯光渐灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}As the light fades from the screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.95,0:02:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,终之章节\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the famous final scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.50,0:02:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你还有10分钟上场\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're on in ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.19,0:02:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,大屏幕上会打出\N{\fnArial\fs30}The label wants to open with.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.42,0:02:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Baby Be My Baby\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby Be My Baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.17,0:02:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来你直接唱Baby Cakes\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you can roll right on into Baby Cakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.78,0:02:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,然后就是Baby Maker的完整版\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then a clean version of Baby Makers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.62,0:02:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,对了 Cory\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh and Cory,let's.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.63,0:02:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,今天 不要过度调戏粉丝好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to take it easy with the groupies,tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.00,0:02:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 随便吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.20,0:02:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事 保安\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell,security.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.37,0:02:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.47,0:02:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Margey你先离开一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Margey you can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.20,0:02:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 Cory\N{\fnArial\fs30}What,Cory.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.05,0:02:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我说话结巴吗 贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bitch,did I stutter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.73,0:03:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你好呀 Gadreel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello,Gadreel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.69,0:03:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Thaddeus 你换了个新面孔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thaddeus,it's a new look,I must say.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.84,0:03:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我还能怎么样呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I say,you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.46,0:03:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,被赶出天堂之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all got booted out of the penthouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.80,0:03:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,总得给自己找个出路\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I just kinda figured.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.88,0:03:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,既然能被他们当成上帝 那我也没必要继续当天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why be an angel you can be a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.13,0:03:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗 老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you,old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.47,0:03:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.87,0:03:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你这么说就不对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're being a little bit mean there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.91,0:03:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,想想咱们一起度过的美好时光吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consider all the quality time we spent together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.06,0:03:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我被监禁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was imprisoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.99,0:03:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,而你酷刑折磨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you tortured me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.34,0:03:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,天堂的那些条条框框\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven has rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.08,0:03:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你犯了事儿 就得坐牢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do the crime,do the time,that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.17,0:03:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是犯了个错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.72,0:03:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是个小小守卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.08,0:03:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我那么做只是尽职尽责\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was doing my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.79,0:03:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那你对Abner做的那些 也是尽职尽责吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you did to Abner,was that your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.70,0:03:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你的男朋友吗 那我只是觉得好玩儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your boyfriend...that,that was just fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.76,0:03:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你来这儿就是为了这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you here for.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.51,0:03:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,来扳回一局\N{\fnArial\fs30}The big pay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.03,0:03:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.85,0:03:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你想玩儿血腥暴力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna get a little bit bloody.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.09,0:03:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不介意再教训你一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,I have no problem kicking your ass again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.58,0:04:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,毕竟看在以往的交情上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll say for old times.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.71,0:04:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,找这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.57,0:04:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Gadreel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gadreel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.48,0:04:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.61,0:04:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.21,0:04:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.56,0:04:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,看看你 西装革履 卷土重来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now look at you,all suited up and back in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.01,0:04:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.70,0:04:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你一召唤我 我就赶过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came as soon as you called,I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.17,0:04:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.04,0:04:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,出什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened,what's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.45,0:05:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sammy当时快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy was dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.45,0:05:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我还能怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was I supposed to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.86,0:05:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你让一个天使附身了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let an angel possess him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.81,0:05:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,他说这是唯一的办法 我就相信了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said it was the only way and I believed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.82,0:05:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 现在Sam不在了 Kevin也 - Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now Sam's gone,Kevin's - Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.46,0:05:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.75,0:05:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.76,0:05:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,但抱歉也无济于事 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry don't pay the bill,does it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.38,0:05:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,明显也不能让Kevin活过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure as hell it ain't gonna bring Kevin back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.40,0:05:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一定要找到那个该死的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta find this son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.82,0:05:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.19,0:05:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,如果附身Sam的天使不是Ezekiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the angel possessing Sam isn't Ezekiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.52,0:05:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then who is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.68,0:05:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,死人一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead man walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.59,0:05:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你想杀了他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What,you're gonna destroy him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.94,0:05:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.97,0:05:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,天使死了 皮囊也活不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kill an angel,its vessel dies too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.46,0:05:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为我不知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think I don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.47,0:05:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我不亲手结束Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I don't end Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.79,0:06:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就得看着那个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that halo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.30,0:06:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,活生生把他折磨死 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burns him out and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.90,0:06:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 我实在是太蠢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God I was so damn stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.88,0:06:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,但你的出发点是好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were stupid for the right reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.22,0:06:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 但这又有什么不同吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,and that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.72,0:06:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,当然有\N{\fnArial\fs30}It does.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.90,0:06:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这一点非常重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes that's all that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.28,0:06:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.22,0:06:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sam很坚强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam is strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.14,0:06:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他知道有个天使在他体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knew an angel was possessing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.04,0:06:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他就会反抗的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.96,0:06:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他能把天使赶出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can cast the angel out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.95,0:06:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.93,0:06:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,但就我所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}But as far as I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.32,0:06:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他现在并不知情\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.65,0:06:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道怎么通知他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how we clue him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.63,0:06:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你还记得Alfie吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember Alfie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.00,0:06:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那个孩子 我记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kid angel,yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.64,0:06:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.41,0:06:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他在临死之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.75,0:06:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.93,0:06:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,恶魔知道怎么钻进他的脑子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demons were able to dig into his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.96,0:06:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,破解天使密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Access his coding.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.59,0:06:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也许可以尝试一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We might be able to do it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.38,0:06:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,说不定能绕开天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might be able to bypass the angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.83,0:06:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,直接跟Sam对上话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And talk directly to Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.18,0:06:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得这么做会管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you think that would work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.61,0:06:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.45,0:07:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,但我觉得值得一试\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I think we should try.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.71,0:07:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.03,0:07:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do we start.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.82,0:07:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你们好呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello,boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.93,0:07:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你做个交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.24,0:07:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你告诉我们怎么黑进天使的大脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna tell us how to hack an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.65,0:07:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就给你注射点儿好东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I’m gonna give you some of the good stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.50,0:07:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,人血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.94,0:07:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,新鲜热乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fresh from the tab.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.56,0:07:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,听说你对这玩意儿很上瘾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Word is you're jonesing for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.05,0:07:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,行行好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.78,0:07:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我不需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.55,0:07:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.81,0:07:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,首先 全身按摩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,for starters,a massage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.24,0:07:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,戴着镣铐坐着的时间太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Between the sitting and the shackles.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.92,0:07:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,身子骨都僵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The body gets a little stiff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.42,0:07:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,叫我给你按摩还不如去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,I ain't rubbing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.57,0:07:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}God no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.84,0:07:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那就去找Kevin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.27,0:07:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他的小拳头做马杀鸡肯定再好不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}His tiny fists can really work wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.67,0:07:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Kevin死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.80,0:07:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.49,0:07:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.95,0:07:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,别装的好像你有多在意似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't pretend that you care.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.44,0:07:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,别忘了你曾经想要他的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tried to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.65,0:08:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我早就知道会发生这种事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told him this was gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.51,0:08:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我是唯一警告过他的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was the only person who tried to warn him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.91,0:08:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我劝他逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told him to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.28,0:08:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,为了提防什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}From what.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.16,0:08:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.45,0:08:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我要说多少次你才会明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times am I gonna have to say this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.70,0:08:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,凡是跟你有关的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}People in your general vicinity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.41,0:08:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,都难逃一死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't have much way of a lifespan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.53,0:08:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.19,0:08:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能教你如何撬开一只天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't teach you how to crack open an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.65,0:08:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个充满了艺术美感的技术活儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's more...art than science.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.11,0:08:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,但我能亲自动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can do it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.55,0:08:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,至于条件 我只想出去放放风\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I ask in return is a little field trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.98,0:08:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,呼吸点儿新鲜空气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dying for some fresh air.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.32,0:08:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 戴着镣铐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chains on,naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.36,0:08:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.96,0:08:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.61,0:08:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,当然不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.95,0:08:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我是A计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because if I'm plan A.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.22,0:08:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我确定你还有个更完美可行的B计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure you have a totally viable much better plan B.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.22,0:08:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能接受他的建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't be considering this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.25,0:08:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,戴着镣铐他什么也干不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the chains on he can't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.87,0:08:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那可是Crowley\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.10,0:08:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,他总有办法做小动作\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can always do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.20,0:08:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来这里需要一个第三方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like we need a tie breaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.03,0:09:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,把麋鹿叫来 小松鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get moose,squirrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.12,0:09:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,除非\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.84,0:09:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 他来不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless of course you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.68,0:09:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你来找我的原因 对不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you're here,isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.40,0:09:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那只巨婴又给自己找麻烦了 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The poor giant baby's in trouble again,isn't he.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.74,0:09:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你废话完了没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.02,0:09:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,看情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Depends.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.62,0:09:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说我们达成协议了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we have a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.61,0:09:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.24,0:09:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好极了 什么时候出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent,when do we leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.64,0:09:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,等我想办法搞到辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as I can scrounge up a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.43,0:09:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我有车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.22,0:09:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道为什么 在几公里外停下不走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It stopped a few miles from here,inexplicably.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.67,0:09:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.21,0:10:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么回事 去拉皮条了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you?A pimp.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.14,0:10:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我还挺喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've liked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.29,0:10:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,只是没油了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,it's out of gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.26,0:10:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,让我猜猜 神奇小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riddle me this,boy wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.39,0:10:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么你会需要一辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you need the wheels.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.06,0:10:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你背叛我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you betray us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.51,0:10:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我就把你的心活活挖出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I’ll be the one to carve out your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.52,0:10:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 Cass 你可真会调情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,Cass.Such a flirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.98,0:10:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.99,0:10:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.75,0:10:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我坐副驾座吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shotgun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.05,0:10:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.71,0:10:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你坐后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.66,0:10:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你也是 好好盯着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,you too,keep an eye on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.41,0:10:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 别挤着我的腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,watch the leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.36,0:10:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你就坐我旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're on my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.67,0:10:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你们够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,hey,hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.72,0:11:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,还需要什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get you need anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.78,0:11:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不用了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good,thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.48,0:11:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎回来 小甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome home,sweethearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.83,0:11:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,看到一幅这么老的皮囊很不习惯吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange seeing an old vessel,isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.26,0:11:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,就好像在看一面哈哈镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like looking into a funhouse mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.76,0:11:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,先谈正事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}But first things first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.24,0:11:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你的任务 有遇到什么麻烦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tasks I gave you,any hiccups.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.13,0:11:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,杀Thaddeus并不难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing Thaddeus was easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.01,0:11:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他死有余辜\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had it coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.08,0:11:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你过去的事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know all about your history.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.15,0:11:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不然我为什么给你他的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you think I give you his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.64,0:11:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,就当是你的入伙奖金好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Considering it your signing bonus.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.06,0:11:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那个孩子呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.36,0:11:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,确实\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.58,0:11:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Less easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.19,0:11:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,他曾是个威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.51,0:11:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,但我改主意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I flipped the switch upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.86,0:11:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 Kevin不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now that Kevin is gone and.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.71,0:11:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,就再也没有先知了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will be no more prophets.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.82,0:12:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean Winchester呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.80,0:12:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你从来没给过我他的名字 Metatron\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never give me his name,Metatron.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.21,0:12:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,看来你还不懂得主动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now much for seizing initiatives,are we.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.33,0:12:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Gadreel 我们在创写我们自己的传奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gadreel,we're writing our own epic story here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.63,0:12:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,要让这一切顺利进行 有时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}To make that work,sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.32,0:12:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须杀了你最爱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to kill your darlings.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.82,0:12:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,又不是说你以前没干过更糟的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like you haven't done worse before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.74,0:12:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry,sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.60,0:12:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,新任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Onto new business.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.88,0:12:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你的下一个目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your next target.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.22,0:12:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我还需要取走多少性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many more lives do I have to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.62,0:12:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你的职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.41,0:12:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不是问问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}To ask questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.41,0:12:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,而是服从命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is your place to obey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.91,0:12:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你想成为我的副手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna be my second in command.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.34,0:12:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那就证明你准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prove you are ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.30,0:12:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,证明你的忠诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prove you are loyal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.56,0:12:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,或者什么都不做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.47,0:13:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,退出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.81,0:13:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你就又是 叛变的Gadreel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back to be Gadreel the traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.39,0:13:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,可悲的倒霉蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.97,0:13:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,天堂里经久不衰的笑话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heaven's longest running joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.41,0:13:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Abaddon\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.44,0:13:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我找到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.93,0:13:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Crowley出来活动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley is on the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.74,0:13:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你的线人在这儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your source is in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.40,0:13:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,她能查到任何你需要的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she can track anything you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.65,0:13:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至是咱们跑丢的Samantha\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even our little lost Samantha.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.16,0:13:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会\N{\fnArial\fs30}How.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.86,0:13:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这个地方 不是看起来的那么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,this place isn't really THIS.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.70,0:14:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这是国家安全局监听部的伪装\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a front for NSA listening post.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.81,0:14:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们在监听什么 - 所有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are they listening for - Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.20,0:14:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,美国政府近些年来有点儿偷窥狂的倾向\N{\fnArial\fs30}The US government is quite the voyeur these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.56,0:14:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我安插了一个最好的手下 让她在里面工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I planted one of my best,and let it go to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.40,0:14:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,寻找恐怖分子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking for terrorists.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.91,0:14:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,寻找一切迹象 笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking for marks,slow boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.34,0:14:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Crowley先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr.Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.48,0:14:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,她现在可以见你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll see you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.97,0:14:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,只见Crowley先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just...Mr.Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.77,0:14:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我会听着你说的每一个字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be listening to every word you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.49,0:14:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,保证哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.20,0:14:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Cecily 别来无恙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cecily,how are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.64,0:14:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,倒是比你好很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.89,0:14:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你来的是Dean Winchester和 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was Dean Winchester and...Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.08,0:14:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂 没有领带的小天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes,I know,without the...tie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.74,0:14:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 确实不太好认 很 - 火辣\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's barely recognizable,so - Hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.67,0:14:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我的意思是 人形Castiel不是我的菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,human Castiel?Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.57,0:14:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,但是天使Castiel 性感极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But feathered Castiel,Phew.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.01,0:14:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,什么人形Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.39,0:14:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道他之前经历了什么 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard what happened to him,right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.86,0:14:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我被绑起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been tied up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.12,0:14:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么尽管说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pray,do tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.70,0:15:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,听到什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hear anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.04,0:15:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.75,0:15:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Crowley进的房间被屏蔽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Room Crowley's been in has been warded.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.54,0:15:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,真棒 真是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome,that's.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.93,0:15:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freaking awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.42,0:15:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说性感小队长 把另一个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Captain Sexy out there,totally cuts another.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.98,0:15:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,的喉咙割开 取走了他的荣光 现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angel's throat,yoinks his grace,and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.80,0:15:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他又是天使了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got his mojo back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.42,0:15:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,但翅膀仍没有复原\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minus the broken wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.97,0:15:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道他为什么会需要一辆车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well that explains the hooptie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.58,0:15:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.61,0:15:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.52,0:15:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我对一颗卫星做了点儿手脚 让它接收天使电台\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tuned up one of our satellites to pick angel radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.80,0:15:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,真厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.76,0:15:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 我可不光是脸蛋漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,not just a pretty face.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.99,0:15:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,地狱那边怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.06,0:15:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 根本就没有人坚守自己的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh,no one's doing their job.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.67,0:15:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我每周都往地狱传很多口讯 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I send oodles of data down there every week,but.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.68,0:15:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,地狱在乎吗 答案是不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does hell give a damn?No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.93,0:15:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 在Abaddon的领导下 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course,with Abaddon in charge you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.94,0:15:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不承认那个婊子是我老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,that B with an Itch ain't the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.48,0:15:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我的意思是 她也只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean she's got a few more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.18,0:15:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,赢得了几个激进分子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aggro types on her side.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.26,0:15:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,但是大多数人还是等着你回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But most just waiting to see you take the belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.13,0:15:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不是你就是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You or her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.67,0:15:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他们还怕我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're still afraid of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.08,0:15:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,估计是因为他们还不知道你被铐住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably cause they don't know you're in cuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.44,0:15:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,说到这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speaking of which.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.16,0:16:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,有办法吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do they come off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.39,0:16:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,没有钥匙就不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not without the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.03,0:16:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.58,0:16:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need you to do me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.42,0:16:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,能帮我找一下这辆车吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you find this car for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.58,0:16:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,小菜一碟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy-peasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.43,0:16:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴知道有人依旧忠诚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice to know someone's still loyal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.24,0:16:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.40,0:16:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 是在你没有两边都讨好的前提下\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is,of course,you're not playing both sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.92,0:16:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你会吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.63,0:16:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你那个开走车的小伙伴 10分钟前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your fellows on wheels just run a red light.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.01,0:16:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,在宾州的萨摩赛特刚闯了红灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Somerset Pennsylvania 10 minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.43,0:16:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.83,0:16:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,三个好闺蜜又要相聚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The three amigos ride again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.33,0:16:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,他不是我闺蜜\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not my amigo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.11,0:17:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Alexandra Sarver吗 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Alexandra Sarver - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.24,0:17:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Gadreel - Abner\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gadreel - Abner.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.62,0:17:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.91,0:17:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,出什么事儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.95,0:17:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这儿干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.35,0:17:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我 你在这儿干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...what are you doing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.90,0:17:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy,daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.76,0:17:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Delilah 这是爸爸最好的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delilah,this is daddy's best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.02,0:17:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,可以打个招呼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you say hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.19,0:17:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.83,0:17:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你有孩子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.42,0:17:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我有家 Gadreel\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have family,Gadreel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.88,0:18:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我妻子待会儿要带她去看电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,my wife and the niblet are going to movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.72,0:18:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,几个小时后回来 我们可以好好聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swing back in a few hours so we can catch up,okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.86,0:18:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好 行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.41,0:18:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,这么说 你有了份工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,you have a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.54,0:18:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,售后服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Customer support.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.92,0:18:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,主要都是电脑问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Computers,mostly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.81,0:18:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,就跟回应祈祷差不多 不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like answering prayers,but.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.57,0:18:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,是付钱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They pay for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.20,0:18:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你变了 Abner - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have changed,Abner - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.16,0:18:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是个称职的天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,I was a crappy angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.01,0:18:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,喜怒无常\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was petulant.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.48,0:18:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我罪有应得\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I deserted my post.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.08,0:18:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我在天堂被关了700年\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spend 7 hundred years in heaven's lockup,I.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.24,0:18:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,算了 都过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.43,0:18:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在跟Thaddeus再无瓜葛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're long way from Thaddeus now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.50,0:18:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我杀了他 Abner\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed him,Abner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.93,0:18:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我们报了仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got our revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.93,0:18:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我倒希望你没那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wish you hadn't done that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.56,0:18:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.60,0:19:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他折磨我们 折磨你最多\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tortured us,you most of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.21,0:19:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.81,0:19:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我还记得你总是在我身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I remember you were always there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.13,0:19:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我疗伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}To put me back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.12,0:19:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那时我们是朋友 - 现在我们也是朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We were friends - We are friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.06,0:19:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这次坠天 是我们的新开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the fall,it’s our second chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.99,0:19:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,忘了我们的仇恨 忘了我们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can forget all our hates,who we were.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.40,0:19:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,说得容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.72,0:19:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,确实很容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes,it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.53,0:19:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,看看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.70,0:19:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我很幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.34,0:19:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你的容器 他幸福吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your vessel,is he happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.88,0:19:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他只是个有施虐倾向的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was an abusive ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.64,0:19:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.55,0:19:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他们也爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.18,0:19:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我一点儿都不聪明 Gadreel\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a wise man,Gadreel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.29,0:19:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我知道 幸福的秘诀\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know this,the key to happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.15,0:19:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是努力得到你最想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's getting the one thing you want most.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.30,0:19:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,之后再也不放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}And never letting it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.95,0:19:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那代价呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what if there's a price.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.02,0:19:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,凡事都有代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's always...a price.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.51,0:19:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,但那都是值得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's worth paying.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.32,0:21:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你不该来这里的 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should not have come here,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.62,0:21:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你杀了我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.27,0:21:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,挟持了我弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you take my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.82,0:21:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得我会放过你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you think I'm gonna let that stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.42,0:21:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我让你活了下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I allowed you to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.29,0:21:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你的疏忽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.02,0:21:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 Crowley来过\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Crowley was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.56,0:21:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我觉得你应该想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,I thought you'd want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.83,0:21:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你想的没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thought right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.89,0:21:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 知道他跑去哪里了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now,any idea where he scampered off to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.43,0:21:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,宾州的萨摩赛特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somerset Pennsylvania.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.26,0:21:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,和Dean Winchester还有Castiel一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}With Dean Winchester and the angel Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.60,0:22:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know this how.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.67,0:22:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在找一辆Impala车\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are chasing an Impala.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.11,0:22:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我帮他们找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I helped them track it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.57,0:22:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你帮助了Crowley吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You,helped Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.38,0:22:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我要伺机而动 直到其中一方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,I'm kinda playing both sides until someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.79,0:22:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,直到你赢了为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until you win.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.37,0:22:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,挺明智的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smart,right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.86,0:22:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.97,0:22:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,恰恰相反\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sort of the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.47,0:22:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎来参加派对 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the party,pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.35,0:22:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Cass 现在什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass,how are we looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.15,0:23:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sam大多数的内伤都恢复了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of Sam's internal burns have healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.82,0:23:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以帮他治好剩下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should be able to fix the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.63,0:23:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.46,0:23:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为我认识天堂里每一个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I knew every angel in heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.02,0:23:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,但我从来没见过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I've never seen you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.58,0:23:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么我要回答你的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I tell you anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.50,0:23:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我不在乎你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't give a damn who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.50,0:23:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你马上给我滚出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.68,0:23:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.59,0:23:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我不走呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.50,0:23:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那么你就要和我愉快地玩耍一阵子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you and I will have a lovely little play date.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.24,0:23:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,就算被绑住了 我还是能把这个肉身撕碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even bound,I can rip this body apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.14,0:23:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉他们 Castiel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them,Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.62,0:23:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这么做了你就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.93,0:23:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你想一切都结束吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want this to end.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.37,0:23:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.86,0:23:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,在你弟弟的心脏上捅一刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put a blade through your brother's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.48,0:23:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,说点让你宽心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it makes you feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.79,0:23:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我把Sam锁在一个梦境里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have Sam locked away in a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.56,0:23:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,所以他现在以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as he knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.69,0:23:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你们两个正在查一个案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two of you are working a case right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.03,0:23:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,有食尸鬼和拉拉队长什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something with ghouls and cheerleaders.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.11,0:23:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.71,0:24:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们曾经并肩作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}We fought together.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.19,0:24:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我那么相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I trusted you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.33,0:24:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你是正义的一方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were one of the good guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.95,0:24:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是在做我必须做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am doing what I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.63,0:24:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.77,0:24:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,还有我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.62,0:25:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我看不下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't watch it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.39,0:25:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.64,0:25:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然折磨的不是Sam 但又还是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not Sam,but,still Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.56,0:25:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多就是这个感觉 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty much,yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.06,0:25:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.51,0:25:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 你在这个时候想到关心我\N{\fnArial\fs30}What,you want to talk about me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.52,0:25:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我想谈谈除了有个恶魔正在用针\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to talk about anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.51,0:25:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,扎进我弟弟脑子里之外的任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not a demon sticking needles into my brother's brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.43,0:25:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,将就我一下 你怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,humor me,how are you doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.09,0:25:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.14,0:25:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good,good,that's.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.52,0:26:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 你换了电池之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,what,you just change your battery.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.07,0:26:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,能量就立刻恢复了 这么容易吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your power's back up,it's that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.45,0:26:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不是那么容易 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't easy,but.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.58,0:26:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我也没有别的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.17,0:26:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,一般都是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's usually how it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.22,0:26:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Cass 我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.93,0:26:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}About what.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.76,0:26:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,把你赶出基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kicking you out of the bunker.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.71,0:26:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,还有 把Sam的情况一直瞒着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's,you know,not telling you about Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.59,0:26:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得他当时命悬一线\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thought his life was at stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.08,0:26:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 但我被人骗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,I got played.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.20,0:26:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我之前也以为我能拯救天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I was saving heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.20,0:26:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我也被骗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got played too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.93,0:26:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你的意思是我们就是一对蠢货吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you say we're both a couple of dumb asses.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.78,0:26:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我比较喜欢 轻信 这个词\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prefer the word,trusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.10,0:26:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不那么蠢 没那么难听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Less dumb,less ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.47,0:26:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Laverne Shirley 别调情了 快过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Laverne!Shirley!Get in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.46,0:26:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然他晕过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pinhead's out cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.25,0:26:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,但你们来看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}But watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.56,0:27:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,他在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is he saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.90,0:27:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.33,0:27:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Gadreel\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gadreel.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.72,0:27:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你想起什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means something to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.39,0:27:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,难怪我从来没见过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,that's why I've never seen him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.78,0:27:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他从创世以来就一直在监狱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been imprisoned since the dawn of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.74,0:27:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他就是那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gadreel was the eccentric.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.82,0:27:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,让Lucifer进入花园的疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who allowed Lucifer into the garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.89,0:27:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 哦 还是个名人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My,my,a celebrity.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.23,0:27:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 花园\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.04,0:27:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,伊甸园吗 亚当和夏娃的花园\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like,Eden,Adam and Eve,fig-leaves garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.53,0:27:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,是他的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's his fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.37,0:27:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,都是他的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.14,0:27:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,人类的堕落\N{\fnArial\fs30}The corruption of man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.59,0:27:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,恶魔 地狱 上帝的出走就是因为他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons,hell,God left because of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.17,0:27:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,大天使们 甚至是天启\N{\fnArial\fs30}The archangels,the apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.38,0:27:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他不那么软弱的话 这些都不会发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he hadn't been so weak,none of it would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.26,0:27:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你毁了整个宇宙 你这个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ruined the universe,you damn son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.14,0:27:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.91,0:27:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.90,0:27:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我理解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.26,0:28:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你得冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you gotta chill.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.52,0:28:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么拖了这么长时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's taking so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.43,0:28:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,除了因为我正在解开一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other than the fact that I'm trying to unravel.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.17,0:28:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,复杂的多维度能量节之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}A living multidimensional knot of pure energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.22,0:28:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,还真没什么别的原因了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not much.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.75,0:28:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不会成功的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.14,0:28:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你永远也不会找到你弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will never find your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.13,0:28:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管激怒我好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead,poke and prod.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.21,0:28:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以年复一年地坐在这里看着你们失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can sit in this chair for years and watch you fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.57,0:28:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,一次又一次地失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.83,0:28:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,比这糟糕的情况我都撑下来了 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've endured much worse than this,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.30,0:28:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕得多的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.33,0:28:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我的时间多着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have all the time in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.71,0:28:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.67,0:29:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 B计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,plan B.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.33,0:29:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.02,0:29:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你得附他的身\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to possess him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.39,0:29:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.84,0:29:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.97,0:29:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你去告诉Sam现在的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in there,tell Sam what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.74,0:29:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,然后让他把那个撒谎的混蛋踹出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And kick that lying son of bitch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.16,0:29:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这也许可以起效\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might work.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.94,0:29:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,但是未经允许我不可以随便附身\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't possess a vessel without permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.52,0:29:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,not happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.94,0:29:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,别蠢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be daft.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.44,0:29:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,恶魔可以随心所欲的附身任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons can take what they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.76,0:29:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我能一铲子挖进这小东西的脑子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can burrow into that rat's nest of a head.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.05,0:29:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,还可以叫醒Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can wake Sam up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.67,0:29:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我是C计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's call me plan C.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.95,0:29:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你还有更好的主意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a better idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.04,0:29:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,那个天使怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.72,0:29:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会待很久的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't last.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.82,0:29:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他找到了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what if he finds you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.03,0:29:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我就逃走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll run.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.45,0:29:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会为你赔上性命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not dying for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.18,0:29:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 如果我这么做的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course if I do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.74,0:29:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你就得 - 给你解开镣铐 我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're gonna have to - Take off the leash,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.71,0:29:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,而且你永远不许再拴住我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it stays off.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.09,0:29:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我救了Sam 你们就还我自由之身\N{\fnArial\fs30}I save Sam.I leave here a free man.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.62,0:29:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,成交吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we have a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.76,0:30:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Cass 烧掉Sam的纹身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass,burn off Sam's tattoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.11,0:30:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.61,0:30:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.94,0:30:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,听我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.97,0:30:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你敢捣乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you mess with Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.49,0:30:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你试图不轨\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you try anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.75,0:30:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我会遵守交易的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep my bargains.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.93,0:30:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,再说 我根本就不愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides I don't want to be inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.27,0:30:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,待在你弟弟身体里太长时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother any longer than I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.09,0:30:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我一秒都不会多待\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not one for sloppy seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.99,0:30:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你找到他的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.48,0:30:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,说 波基普西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say Poughkeepsie.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.15,0:30:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们之间的暗语 意思是什么都不要管 快逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our code word means drop everything and run.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.45,0:31:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.11,0:31:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我不在的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.82,0:31:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,别乱动我的肉身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands off the suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.43,0:31:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我会弄死你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.78,0:31:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.06,0:31:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,恶魔和天使同时在我弟弟身体里\N{\fnArial\fs30}A demon and an angel walk into my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.97,0:31:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,听起来好像冷笑话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds like a bad joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.15,0:31:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean 如果行不通的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean,if this doesn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.26,0:31:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,行得通\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll work.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.76,0:31:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这根本没什么道理啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean It just doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.16,0:31:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么这个食尸鬼只吃死掉的拉拉队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is this ghoul chomping on dead cheerleaders.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.81,0:31:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,要啤酒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want a beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.69,0:32:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.35,0:32:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.14,0:32:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.90,0:32:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,波基普西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poughkeepsie.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.19,0:32:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道这个词的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know that word.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.54,0:32:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,因为是Dean送我进来的 麋鹿同学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because Dean sent me Bullwinkle.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.62,0:32:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,真正的Dean 我长话短说\N{\fnArial\fs30}The real Dean ,I'll make this quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.41,0:32:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你被一个天使附身了 他把你关进了一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been possessed by an angel and he's got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.97,0:32:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你自己思维里的小角落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Packed away in some dusty corner of your own mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.05,0:32:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我是来救你出去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm here to break you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.43,0:32:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,认真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.83,0:32:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.46,0:32:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,那就玩玩儿好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll do this the fun way.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.96,0:32:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,看到了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}See.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.75,0:32:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,如我所说 都不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not real,like I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.81,0:32:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道附身是什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how possession works,Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.27,0:32:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你能看到所有 他看到的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've seen everything that he's seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.76,0:32:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,即使你不记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if you can't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.98,0:32:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我需要你做的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what I need you to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.18,0:32:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,把记忆找回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.25,0:33:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我杀了Kevin吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I kill Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.50,0:33:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不是你杀的 是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,you didn't,he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.74,0:33:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你要掌控你自己 Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to take control Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.75,0:33:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,掌控一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blow it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.23,0:33:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,把那个混蛋天使赶出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And cast that punk ass holy roller out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.15,0:33:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.72,0:33:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,真讨厌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh bollocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.88,0:33:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.74,0:33:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.85,0:33:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他名字叫Gadreel\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is Gadreel.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.99,0:33:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,最早的那个笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}The original chump.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.73,0:33:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,曾经是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was a chump.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.92,0:33:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,但是现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.98,0:33:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我要带领\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to be the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.90,0:33:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我的族人回天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}That leads my kind back to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.37,0:33:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我将是一个英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to be a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.38,0:33:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,而你 恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you,demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.81,0:33:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,从始至终就只能是一个懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}For all your chatter you will always be a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.82,0:33:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该逃跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be running.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.60,0:34:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,放弃吧 小朋友 你还不够壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give up boy,you are not strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.58,0:34:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,自己控制自己Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take control Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.99,0:34:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,把他赶出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cast him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.32,0:34:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你给我出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of my.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.14,0:34:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定你想让我走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure you want me to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.35,0:34:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,或许我才是那个让你不散架的关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I'm the only thing holding you together.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.76,0:34:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我走了你会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I leave you might die.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.37,0:34:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.59,0:34:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.06,0:34:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,出\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.84,0:34:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.19,0:34:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,在等什么人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waiting for someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.56,0:34:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.22,0:35:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不过他迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's late.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.49,0:35:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.10,0:35:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,让我猜猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.01,0:35:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Winchester兄弟找你麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winchester trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.41,0:35:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.88,0:35:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.46,0:35:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我很好 多谢关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine thanks for asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.46,0:35:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sam 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam,are you OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.72,0:35:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Cass\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.10,0:36:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,是Abaddon\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Abaddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.71,0:36:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.01,0:36:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,走后门\N{\fnArial\fs30}The back door.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.78,0:36:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我来应付\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.79,0:36:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你是个大好人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh cause you're such a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.00,0:36:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,眼下我是你这辈子遇到过的最好的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now I'm the goodest guy you've ever got.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.45,0:36:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,这不代表我们俩两清了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This don't make us square.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.87,0:36:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我还会找你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.65,0:36:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我是你的 我明白 我也爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dead,Yes I know,I love you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.13,0:36:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你们一起工作真是荣幸之至啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pleasure doing business with you boys as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.25,0:36:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你好啊 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.43,0:36:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Crowley\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.21,0:36:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,把他的人头给我拿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring me his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.21,0:37:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,看到了吗 这就是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}See that's the thing about demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.69,0:37:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的服从只是暂时的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are only obedient to a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.73,0:37:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 让我们谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right,let's have a chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.50,0:37:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是来聊天的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not here to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.97,0:37:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我也没跟你说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm not talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.87,0:37:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我在跟他们说 其他的恶魔们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking to them,the average demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.42,0:37:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我能感受到他们的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I feel their pains.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.40,0:37:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你们一定过得很艰辛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must have been difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.57,0:37:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的王被从你们身边带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}With your loving king so cruely be taken from ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.11,0:37:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你们一定觉得茫然不知所措\N{\fnArial\fs30}I imagine you felt all at sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.36,0:37:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,随之而来的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then along came.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.40,0:37:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,一个小畜生\N{\fnArial\fs30}The brute.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.64,0:37:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,她很强壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.63,0:37:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,挂着骑士的头衔 有着永生的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a knight and immortal at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.04,0:37:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,所以看见一些愚笨的旧部下买了她的账\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm not surprised that some of my.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.87,0:37:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我并不惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}More idiotic subject bought her line.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.80,0:37:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,但是现在 好消息 同志们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now,good news fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.95,0:37:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,老爸回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.22,0:37:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,地狱不欢迎你 Crowley\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell doesn't want you Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.17,0:37:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,它是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.72,0:37:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.94,0:37:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这儿就不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not would I here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.61,0:37:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我还活着一天就不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not while I'm still kicking.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.20,0:37:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧那就让我们解决这个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well let's settle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.13,0:38:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你和我此时此地\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.08,0:38:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,成者为王败者为寇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winner takes the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.11,0:38:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}See.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.17,0:38:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你的问题了 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your problem love.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.10,0:38:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你认为这是场战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think that is a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.93,0:38:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.95,0:38:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一场竞赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a campaign.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.25,0:38:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,人心和头脑才是最重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hearts and minds that's what's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.00,0:38:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,恶魔们可以做出选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}See demons have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.51,0:38:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,他们可以选择屈从这个暴怒的红发女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take orders from the world angriest ginger.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.52,0:38:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,没有权利 没有尊严\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's saying something.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.81,0:38:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,或者加入我的团队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or join my team.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.30,0:38:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我保证所有人都有发言权 一个处女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where everyone gets a say,a virgin.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.83,0:38:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一大堆鲜美的内脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all the entrails they can eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.39,0:38:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,好好想想吧 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So think on this lads.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.85,0:38:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,给大家传话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spread the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.66,0:38:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,支持Crowley\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vote Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.19,0:38:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,觉得好点了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.33,0:38:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.06,0:39:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,要完全治愈你还需要时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll take time to fully heal you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.96,0:39:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,必须一步一步来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to do it in stages.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.34,0:39:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 有什么话就说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right let me hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.94,0:39:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你想让我说什么 我生气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you want me to say,I'm pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.17,0:39:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧是的 我生气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK I am,I'm pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.97,0:39:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你骗我 又一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lie to me,again.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.63,0:39:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我没得选\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.63,0:39:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经准备好去死了 Dean\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was ready to die,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.03,0:39:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.97,0:39:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我没让你这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I wouldn't let you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.91,0:39:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,因为那不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it's not in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.53,0:39:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,所以呢 你就决定骗我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what,you decide to trick me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.53,0:39:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,让我被一个神经天使附身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Into being possessed by some psycho angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.37,0:39:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,他救了你的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saved your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.28,0:39:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,那又如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.88,0:39:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我愿意去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was willing to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.67,0:39:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,现在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.00,0:39:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Kevin\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.81,0:39:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不 这事儿不能怪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,that is not on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.48,0:39:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Kevin的血染在我手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin's blood is on my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.95,0:40:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我永远也洗不清\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that ain't never getting clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.91,0:40:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我会为此下地狱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll burn for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.34,0:40:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.96,0:40:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我会找到Gadreel\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I will find Gadreel.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.73,0:40:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我会杀了那个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will end that son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.57,0:40:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我会一个人去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'll do it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.27,0:40:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that suppose to mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.44,0:40:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on man.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.20,0:40:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你不明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.86,0:40:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我被诅咒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm poisoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.20,0:40:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sam 靠近我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam people that get close to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.03,0:40:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,都会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}They get killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.85,0:40:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,或者更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.49,0:40:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,是 我告诉自己我救的人比我伤的人更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah I tell myself that I helped more people than I hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.18,0:40:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉我自己我做这些是出于好意\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I tell myself that I do it all for the right reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.03,0:40:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我也相信是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.15,0:40:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我不能 也不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can't,I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.93,0:40:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,再让别人跟我一起趟这浑水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drag anybody to the muck with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.21,0:40:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,再也不能了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.99,0:40:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.36,0:40:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会拦着你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.52,0:41:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但别觉得这是一切的症结所在 因为事实并不是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't go thinking that's the problem cause it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.66,0:41:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that suppose to mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.84,0:41:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go
